{
  "name": "official-variants",
  "description": "The official geometries under the flags the problem statement leaves to the script: every runnable geometry with padding_ratio 0.4 (distinct -pad case names so calibration treats them as additional cases of the same dispatch group), and bf16/fp16 lanes on a representative spread. These rows are what makes the calibration's padded-and-dense guarantee a measurement instead of a shared-code-path argument.",
